  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat RPM Blast is one of the world's most iconic polyester strings. Its octagonal high-density co-polyester construction generates exceptional spin, maximum control and outstanding durability. Designed for advanced players with fast swing speeds, RPM Blast is best known as Rafael Nadal's signature string.",

    "zh": "Babolat RPM Blast 是全球最具代表性的聚酯球线之一，采用八边形高密度共聚酯结构，可提供极强旋转、卓越控制以及极高耐久性。适合挥拍速度快、追求现代旋转打法的中高级及职业球员，也是 Rafael Nadal 长期使用的标志性球线。"
  },

